[{"slug":"balenciaga","designer":"Balenciaga","season":"2026 春夏成衣","title":"在身体外留出可见空气层","summary":"Piccioli 从历史 Sack Dress 提取与腰部无关的垂落体积，并在圆鼓短夹克、斜边褶饰和披缠裙上拓展它。","fabric":"直身裙可试中等挺度的哑面塔夫或双面织物；袋形斜摆应留无衬活动区。系列亦出现皮质泡形夹克，提供硬面料的体积参考。","color":"暗黑适合辨认长线轮廓；外壳单品可用苦艾绿或品红，内层降饱和。","silhouette":"肩背是悬挂点，胸腰具有活动余量，下摆决定外鼓还是长直柱；一处背领开口让后视图变化。","techniques":["把腰省移入缝份或取消，先从侧面校正前后衣长和平衡。","在下摆加可拆窄形撑条，试动后比较鼓量与手感变化。"],"tags":["雕塑支撑","垂坠","宽松体积","茧形"],"palette":[{"name":"深夜黑","hex":"#1F1D22"},{"name":"苦艾绿","hex":"#A6B33F"},{"name":"品红","hex":"#AD3C72"}],"sources":[{"title":"Vogue Runway · Balenciaga 2026 春夏成衣系列报道","url":"https://www.vogue.com/fashion-shows/spring-2026-ready-to-wear/balenciaga"},{"title":"Balenciaga 2026 春夏成衣秀场原图集","url":"https://www.vogue.com/fashion-shows/spring-2026-ready-to-wear/balenciaga/slideshow/collection"}],"images":[{"label":"秀场造型 01","url":"https://assets.vogue.com/photos/68e19904989311c210463605/master/w_960%2Cc_limit/00001-balenciaga-spring-2026-ready-to-wear-credit-gorunway.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://assets.vogue.com/photos/68e19904989311c210463605/master/w_360%2Cc_limit/00001-balenciaga-spring-2026-ready-to-wear-credit-gorunway.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://www.vogue.com/fashion-shows/spring-2026-ready-to-wear/balenciaga/slideshow/collection","credit":"Vogue Runway · 摄影署名见原图集"},{"label":"秀场造型 03","url":"https://assets.vogue.com/photos/68e185dea3cb008f25328631/master/w_960%2Cc_limit/00003-balenciaga-spring-2026-ready-to-wear-credit-gorunway.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://assets.vogue.com/photos/68e185dea3cb008f25328631/master/w_360%2Cc_limit/00003-balenciaga-spring-2026-ready-to-wear-credit-gorunway.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://www.vogue.com/fashion-shows/spring-2026-ready-to-wear/balenciaga/slideshow/collection","credit":"Vogue Runway · 摄影署名见原图集"},{"label":"秀场造型 05","url":"https://assets.vogue.com/photos/68e185e0a3cb008f25328633/master/w_960%2Cc_limit/00005-balenciaga-spring-2026-ready-to-wear-credit-gorunway.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://assets.vogue.com/photos/68e185e0a3cb008f25328633/master/w_360%2Cc_limit/00005-balenciaga-spring-2026-ready-to-wear-credit-gorunway.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://www.vogue.com/fashion-shows/spring-2026-ready-to-wear/balenciaga/slideshow/collection","credit":"Vogue Runway · 摄影署名见原图集"}]},{"slug":"carolina-herrera-spring-2027","designer":"Carolina Herrera","season":"2027 春夏成衣","title":"让硬白衬衫托住透明礼裙","summary":"Wes Gordon 将白衬衫、黑白点纹和透明礼服重新组合，日常上身的清晰结构给大裙体定位。","fabric":"秀评可核对清脆的白衬衫、透明裙与欧根纱装饰。试样用府绸做领口与肩部，以薄纱或欧根纱做体积，里层短窄以保留透度。","color":"黑与白建立轮廓上下关系；暖金点饰限于纽扣或小面积胸前，避免和波点抢对比。","silhouette":"收拢腰部、清楚的小肩线，配外扩半透下装。衬衫式连衣裙也可用同一逻辑。","techniques":["把裙层重量放在独立的内腰封","验证白衬衫与薄纱叠加后门襟轮廓仍清楚"],"tags":["雕塑支撑","镂空透层","垂坠"],"palette":[{"name":"衬衫白","hex":"#F0EEE5"},{"name":"墨黑","hex":"#24232B"},{"name":"暖金","hex":"#BC984F"},{"name":"烟灰","hex":"#777275"}],"sources":[{"title":"Vogue Runway · Carolina Herrera 2027 春夏成衣","url":"https://www.vogue.com/fashion-shows/spring-2027-ready-to-wear/carolina-herrera"}],"images":[{"label":"秀场造型 01","url":"https://assets.vogue.com/photos/6aa8982f947c2b3553658d3a/master/w_960%2Cc_limit/00001-carolina-herrera-spring-2027-ready-to-wear-credit-gorunway.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://assets.vogue.com/photos/6aa8982f947c2b3553658d3a/master/w_360%2Cc_limit/00001-carolina-herrera-spring-2027-ready-to-wear-credit-gorunway.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://www.vogue.com/fashion-shows/spring-2027-ready-to-wear/carolina-herrera/slideshow/collection","credit":"Vogue Runway · 摄影署名见原图集"},{"label":"秀场造型 03","url":"https://assets.vogue.com/photos/6aa8982f16b3f3103d23143f/master/w_960%2Cc_limit/00003-carolina-herrera-spring-2027-ready-to-wear-credit-gorunway.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://assets.vogue.com/photos/6aa8982f16b3f3103d23143f/master/w_360%2Cc_limit/00003-carolina-herrera-spring-2027-ready-to-wear-credit-gorunway.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://www.vogue.com/fashion-shows/spring-2027-ready-to-wear/carolina-herrera/slideshow/collection","credit":"Vogue Runway · 摄影署名见原图集"},{"label":"秀场造型 05","url":"https://assets.vogue.com/photos/6aa89831677112612d6ffa33/master/w_960%2Cc_limit/00005-carolina-herrera-spring-2027-ready-to-wear-credit-gorunway.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://assets.vogue.com/photos/6aa89831677112612d6ffa33/master/w_360%2Cc_limit/00005-carolina-herrera-spring-2027-ready-to-wear-credit-gorunway.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://www.vogue.com/fashion-shows/spring-2027-ready-to-wear/carolina-herrera/slideshow/collection","credit":"Vogue Runway · 摄影署名见原图集"}]},{"slug":"feng-chen-wang","designer":"Feng Chen Wang","season":"2027 春夏秀场","title":"用坚挺边缘框住半透明层","summary":"官方系列借竹林与花园并置，明确提出硬与软、实与透的关系。可选择肩、胸或腰的一处边界去放大差异。","fabric":"试作硬挺夹层承担转折，柔软织物承担下坠，让一层轻透面料覆盖微小花叶色阶。外层的固定点不穿过主可视区。","color":"以竹灰和苔绿做中介，素纸白保留透明层的光，细点褐红可作试配。","silhouette":"男装结构线保持清楚，半透明片越过一条边即可，如一片肩屋檐下露出轻飘的侧片。","techniques":["用粗细不同的同色条带标出透层边框，逆光检查阴影会否吞掉细纹","从袖窿至侧腰设置两处暗扣，单独评估软层摆动范围。"],"tags":["镂空透层","解构剪裁","垂坠","雕塑支撑"],"palette":[{"name":"素纸白","hex":"#E9E5D8"},{"name":"竹灰","hex":"#A6A497"},{"name":"苔绿","hex":"#5D6954"},{"name":"褐红","hex":"#8A5549"}],"sources":[{"title":"Feng Chen Wang 官方系列与图集","url":"https://fengchenwang.com/pages/spring-summer-27"}],"images":[{"label":"Look 01 · 系列秀图","url":"https://fengchenwang.com/cdn/shop/files/FCW_ss27_runway_IG_look_01.jpg?v=1782446395","sourceUrl":"https://fengchenwang.com/pages/spring-summer-27","credit":"Feng Chen Wang 官方秀图"}]}]
